---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About"
  description="Trailmike is a quiet journal of backpacking adventures and building edge AI — no social feeds required."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap about">
      <p class="eyebrow fade-up">About</p>
      <h1 class="fade-up-delay">Trailmike</h1>
      <div class="prose fade-up-delay-2">
        <p>
          I’m Mike. I backpack when I can, and I’m building edge AI systems when I’m home — currently
          real-time vision on a Jetson, aimed at wildlife and fish detection in the field.
        </p>
        <p>
          This site is a journal. Just trip write-ups and build notes I want to keep in one place.
        </p>
        <p>
          You’ll find route notes, weather, gear lessons, and the moments that stuck from trips like
          Iceland, Glacier, Zion and the Grand Canyon, the Tetons, Yellowstone, and Olympic. On the
          tech side: what it takes to ship models that run off the cloud.
        </p>
        <p>
          If something here is useful for your own trip or
          build, that’s enough.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-actions fade-up-delay-2">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/adventures">Browse adventures</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/edge-ai">Edge AI journal</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 1.25rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 3.8rem);
  }

  .prose {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .prose p {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .about-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }
</style>
